  "id": "youssef-harby/geoparquet-overviews",
  "title": "geoparquet-overviews",
  "description": "A reference/demo dataset for the \"geoparquet-overviews\" draft convention, which embeds a simplified overview geometry alongside full-resolution geometry in a single GeoParquet file so it renders instantly in a web map while remaining fully queryable by SQL. It packages example conversions of Finnish topographic (MTK) building and terrain features and Overture Maps building footprints for Tokyo, across multiple convention versions (root, v0.1.0, v0.2.0, v0.3.0).",
  "keywords": [
    "geoparquet",
    "geoparquet-overviews",
    "building-footprints",
    "topography",
    "elevation"
  ],
